        \\/* kizu_net_wait blocks until the descriptor is ready or the budget runs out.
        \\ * Its callers reach it only after the syscall itself said EAGAIN, so a
        \\ * connection with bytes already in it never gets here: what a wait would have
        \\ * told them, the read already did.
